      "name": "Drain Life Build",
      "label": "Recommended",
      "description": "Gul'dan's Drain Life Build is currently the best build to use on Gul'dan as it drastically improves your survibability by empowering Drain Life. The Talent choices in this build focuses heavily on reducing the downside of picking Gul'dan which is mainly having the Healer always healing Gul'dan due to how Life Tap works. With the Drain Life build, Gul'dan will have superb lane presence and lane sustain, in the later levels he gets alot of added burst damage if you manage to play around Darkness Within. Be careful when playing against interrupts.",
